            kill: "yes",
            id: "Baldras",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Skiff",
            type: "Skiff",
            side: 1,
            x: 0,
            y: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Skiff",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_5",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Relentlessly pursued by riders patrolling the road to Elensefar, Baldras and the villagers traveled unseen along the swampy banks of the Great River to the city of Carcyn. They hid until nightfall, then crept out to find the help Lord Maddock hinted was here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Skiff",
            x: 6,
            y: 4,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:unstore_unit",
            variable: "stored_Baldras",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Harper",
            unit: "Harper",
            x: 8,
            y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("Wow, is that Carcyn in the distance? Look at how grand some of them spires be!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Not since I were a young lad did I come this far south. Maybe it looks impressive now, but city life weren’t never something real nice. Them city folk be real impatient and mean. Always wantin’ some price for their help, too."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("Well, we need their help now, don’t we? So we got to figure out a way to get to Lord Maddock’s friend. But he didn’t say anything about who that was."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Harper, when a noble lord says he don’t want some kind of relationship known, it means some kind o’ connection with the black market. We be looking for criminals, probably some thieves’ den. Or, maybe they be looking for us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Link",
            type: "Thief",
            side: 4,
            x: 5,
            y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Link",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Right on time."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("How do we know we can trust him?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Link",
            text: _("If you were one of my quarries, your throat would be slit by now. As it is, you two are still in imminent danger. Just a week ago, the Crown sent a contingent of heavy infantry here to supervise the city. They’re patrolling the streets and forests for us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("I be assuming they’ll also try to stop us if they see us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Link",
            text: _("Very likely. Now hurry, you must make it past the city into the Grey Woods. There is a small path in the southeast that leads into the forest. Look for the signpost. My brother Hans will guide you from there. Avoid the soldiers if you can."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 25,
            y: 47,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: 26,
            y: 48,
            item_name: "",
            image: "scenery%2Fsignpost.png",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 300,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:remove_item",
            x: 26,
            y: 48,
            item_name: "",
            image: "",
          },
