          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("I haven’t run so much in years. Feels like I be a real outlaw now, infiltrating a heavily guarded city relyin’ on nothing but the cover of darkness and my wits."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("It was fun, wasn’t it?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Perhaps a little."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Hans",
            text: _("Enough chatter, you still have some guards on your tail. We need to head deeper into the Grey Woods to lose them."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Lead the way."),
